package engine

var delegationDescriptions = map[string]string{
	"spawn_agent": "Delegate a bounded multi-step task when authorized; handle tiny lookups or edits directly. Send independent spawns together. Foreground children in Flagship overlap parent work by default; set overlap=false only if the very next parent step immediately blocks on the result (outside Flagship, set overlap=true to opt in). Completed overlapping results arrive automatically—do not re-fetch an un-truncated completion with wait_agent. Detached background children complete as later notices. Extra children queue at the concurrency limit. Keep the returned session and turn IDs.\n\n" +
		"Give each child its goal, disjoint scope, known path:line facts, expected output, and stop condition. For a new child, pass the exact roster role key whose responsibilities fit, or omit role to use this turn's model. Children inherit the worktree, mode, model settings, and permissions (read-only roles run in Plan) and cannot delegate. Use guide_agent for follow-ups; to continue an idle child with spawn_agent, pass its exact session ID and omit role. Do not restart user-stopped or cancelled children unless asked.",
	"guide_agent":    "Send new directions to a child owned by this conversation using its exact session ID. A running child receives guidance at its next tool or model boundary; an idle child starts a new foreground task keeping its history, role, model, worktree, and permissions (overlapping by default in Flagship unless overlap is set). Queued or stopping children cannot be restarted.",
	"wait_agent":     "Wait for an unfinished child's final answer within a bounded window, or fetch the full answer when an automatic completion was marked response_truncated. Launch ready children and finish independent parent work first; send independent waits together. Do not call wait_agent for a child whose un-truncated automatic completion already arrived, and do not poll pending receipts or running background children. Pass exact session ID (and turn ID when known). Returns early with guidance_pending if new user guidance arrives.",
	"stop_agent":     "Stop a queued or running child owned by this conversation when its work is no longer needed, using its exact session ID. Cancels the child, suppresses its partial result, and returns its final status. Do not stop user-requested work without a reason.",
	"list_subagents": "List this conversation's direct subagent sessions across turns (exact session/turn IDs, title, role, status, pause, and stop_reason). Pass next_before as before until null; listing never resumes work. Only continue a child when continuing the same unfinished task and prior calls or receipts confirm its scope (a title alone is not evidence). Do not reopen running, queued, or stopping children, and never resume a cancelled or separately stopped child—or an interruption that could have been a deliberate stop—without an explicit request.",
}
